WEBVTT

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:02.740
The day has come at last...

00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:06.940
But still, I have to warn you!
Don't sit too close while watching TV!

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:15.160
No way, I don't believe it.
She ripped up the marriage registration, too.

00:00:15.550 --> 00:00:18.820
I hope that she'll somehow get back together with Tomonori-kun, but...

00:00:18.820 --> 00:00:20.800
That may prove difficult.

00:00:21.290 --> 00:00:24.170
Her words came as such a surprise.

00:00:24.870 --> 00:00:30.450
I won't be returning to my hus- ...to Tomonori.

00:00:30.820 --> 00:00:32.000
I can't go back.

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:35.010
But you weren't serious when you gave him the divorce form, right?

00:00:35.010 --> 00:00:37.560
But... he signed it...

00:00:37.560 --> 00:00:40.670
Tomonori-kun just got carried away on the spur of the moment.

00:00:40.670 --> 00:00:44.440
No, that's not it.
He's been avoiding me all this time.

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:48.360
He must've started to hate me for real.

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.150
This isn't like you, Rizel.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:53.460
You're usually optimistic enough to stand up to anything!

00:00:53.460 --> 00:00:57.580
I thought you'd make up with Tomonori-kun when you rescued him earlier...

00:00:57.580 --> 00:00:59.110
I couldn't.

00:00:59.680 --> 00:01:04.040
I felt pain in my heart,
like I was about to start crying.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:06.120
That'd never happened before.

00:01:06.470 --> 00:01:08.270
It was completely hopeless...

00:01:09.990 --> 00:01:13.010
Maybe I should look for a new love.

00:01:13.310 --> 00:01:18.160
So, Papas... Please delete everything about Tomonori from inside me.

00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:24.460
So now she knows what true love is.

00:01:24.460 --> 00:01:26.540
Are you just going to reset her?

00:01:26.540 --> 00:01:28.690
Let's wait a bit and see what happens.

00:01:28.990 --> 00:01:31.360
We might be able to change her mind.

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:35.280
In the meantime, keep an eye on
Tomonori-kun's actions.

00:01:35.640 --> 00:01:39.200
Still... in the event that the worst does come to pass...

00:03:19.640 --> 00:03:22.510
As we thought, only Rizel-chan's belongings are missing.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:25.120
And Tomonori has left without even telling us anything...

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:27.470
What on Earth could have happened?

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.250
You don't suppose...

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:39.330
What could've happened to Rizel-chan?

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.130
Is she sick?

00:03:40.130 --> 00:03:43.270
I've heard a rumor that she left Iwaki-kun's house, but...

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.930
What's the story behind that?

00:03:46.910 --> 00:03:49.230
Iwaki-kun, where's Rizel-chan?

00:03:49.530 --> 00:03:50.610
Iwaki-kun!

00:03:51.740 --> 00:03:54.110
Hey, Iwaki-kun!

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:55.890
Come on!

00:03:55.890 --> 00:03:57.770
Good morning!

00:03:57.770 --> 00:04:01.960
Okay everyone, take your seats!
That includes you, Seimoto-san!

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:05.030
Time for another wonderful day of studying!

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:16.340
Tomonori. Huh?

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.720
Aren't you worried?

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:21.850
Don't you even feel like looking for her?

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:23.310
Tomonori!

00:04:56.550 --> 00:04:59.080
Off to school, the same as always...

00:04:59.080 --> 00:05:00.220
No!

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:04.100
So he's finally taking action?

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:11.150
Hey, are you alone?
Want to join me for karaoke?

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:18.490
I didn't imagine expect him to come to such a crowded place.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.510
I thought he was going to search for Rizel...

00:05:21.510 --> 00:05:23.530
Let's observe for a while longer.

00:05:41.560 --> 00:05:43.820
Hey there! Where're you off to?

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:45.580
Come on, let's go somewhere together...

00:05:47.120 --> 00:05:49.950
Perhaps our sense of dread was justified.

00:05:52.780 --> 00:05:54.800
All right, time to head home!

00:05:54.800 --> 00:05:57.050
Iwaki-kun never showed up, did he?

00:05:57.050 --> 00:05:59.950
He's been fooling around every day lately.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:03.630
My mom said that she saw him at some popular pick-up spot.

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:06.520
Now that his wife's run off,
maybe he's playing the field!

00:06:06.520 --> 00:06:09.130
What?! He's already
moving on to other girls?!

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:10.590
What's up with that?

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:13.380
Matsui from Class C has seen him, too!

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:16.420
I may be moving.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:18.930
Where to?

00:06:18.930 --> 00:06:21.760
It's a sudden development,
so we don't know yet.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:24.630
So, if it turns out that we do...

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:28.320
...then maybe I could move in next to
your house, Ryuu-kun!

00:06:29.040 --> 00:06:30.360
I'd love that!

00:06:37.210 --> 00:06:38.570
Please, Inukichi...

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:41.710
I have no idea where Rizel-chan is.

00:06:41.710 --> 00:06:45.360
But if you can track her scent,
please give her this letter.

00:06:46.390 --> 00:06:49.790
It says that the whole thing with Iwaki-kun was just a misunderstanding.

00:06:56.650 --> 00:06:58.180
Isn't it time to give up?

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:01.590
He's right. It's pointless to continue this.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:09.970
I guess we were just hoping for too much.

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:22.190
Are you confident that this analysis is reliable?

00:07:22.520 --> 00:07:25.800
I regret to say it, but it's the only explanation that fits.

00:07:27.480 --> 00:07:30.950
Rizel! Good timing. Come here!

00:07:31.890 --> 00:07:35.170
He's been cruising the hot
pick-up spots for the last few days,

00:07:35.170 --> 00:07:37.840
instead of looking for you!

00:07:38.090 --> 00:07:40.720
You're better off forgetting about that jerk!

00:07:40.720 --> 00:07:43.170
Coming back here was the correct decision.

00:07:43.450 --> 00:07:45.910
We'll begin the reset procedure.

00:07:45.910 --> 00:07:48.990
Understood. Check all the data one last time.

00:07:48.990 --> 00:07:50.180
Roger.

00:08:02.360 --> 00:08:04.150
He couldn't be...

00:08:04.510 --> 00:08:05.870
Papas!

00:08:11.010 --> 00:08:13.950
There's something that I want to be sure of.

00:08:14.330 --> 00:08:16.210
Would you like to take a survey?

00:09:01.260 --> 00:09:03.460
What am I doing?

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:10.840
Doing this won't make a bit of difference, will it?

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.340
What's <i>wrong</i>  with me?

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:19.060
Why do I feel so lonely?

00:09:19.650 --> 00:09:22.860
Why am I crying like this?

00:09:33.450 --> 00:09:35.770
And now, everything is gone.

00:09:36.790 --> 00:09:38.660
Everything that ever connected us...

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:31.170
RIZEL!!!

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:49.860
You really were looking
for me all this time.

00:11:04.140 --> 00:11:07.170
Ah! This is...!

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:14.410
The old one was kind of messed up, anyway...

00:11:15.380 --> 00:11:17.510
Let's go turn this one in together.

00:11:17.730 --> 00:11:19.350
My darling husband...!

00:11:21.150 --> 00:11:24.690
Is it... is it okay if I make lots of explosions?

00:11:24.690 --> 00:11:25.700
Sure.

00:11:51.840 --> 00:11:54.430
Huh? It didn't explode...

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:57.080
Huh, you're right.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:11:59.930
Darling!

00:12:00.230 --> 00:12:01.980
I love you!!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:09.610
He fell asleep.

00:12:10.090 --> 00:12:12.110
Because your breasts feel
so wonderful, Kyouko-san!

00:12:12.110 --> 00:12:13.750
Oh, Ryuu-kun!

00:12:13.750 --> 00:12:15.950
I'd like to have about nine kids.

00:12:15.950 --> 00:12:16.370
Okay!

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:17.120
YOU!!!

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:18.200
Leave them alone.

00:12:18.200 --> 00:12:20.090
I'll make you all nice and clean!

00:12:22.540 --> 00:12:24.780
You just called me "Aoi," didn't you!?

00:12:25.250 --> 00:12:27.240
Now you scrub me clean, Inukichi!

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:30.420
How was the movie?

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:33.180
Thanks to you folks,
we're really reliving our youth.

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:34.920
I bet Tomonori-kun will be surprised...

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:37.600
First this child,
and now another sibling on the way!

00:12:37.600 --> 00:12:39.930
Now now, we're still trying...

00:12:39.930 --> 00:12:42.510
Papa A, I'm going to a bargain sale!
Give me some money!

00:12:42.810 --> 00:12:45.480
If you're moving back in here,
you'd better start calling me "Father"!

00:12:45.480 --> 00:12:48.680
Yes, <i>Father.</i> So, about that money?

00:12:52.210 --> 00:12:56.260
Do you want any more?
Or can I bite "yours" this time?

00:12:59.160 --> 00:13:00.530
I'll have some now...

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:01.950
Never give up!

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:04.120
It's a challenge! I'll get him,
I'm sure of it!!

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:06.130
Millennium Launcher Attack!

00:13:06.130 --> 00:13:07.590
If that's how she's
going to be, then...

00:13:07.590 --> 00:13:09.500
Thunder Storm!!

00:13:09.500 --> 00:13:10.870
I... can't... lose!

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:13.800
Super-Altitude High Kick!!

00:13:13.800 --> 00:13:15.610
I'm going to win this time!

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.600
Bicycle Thief Spike!

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:19.760
Hold it right there!!

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:26.130
Now the <i>real</i>  fight begins!

00:13:27.060 --> 00:13:29.280
Darling!

00:13:31.690 --> 00:13:33.040
You're too slow!

00:13:33.040 --> 00:13:34.650
Sorry!

00:13:36.320 --> 00:13:38.780
You dummy! This is what you get
for running while you eat.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:42.370
Thank you, Darling!

00:13:42.370 --> 00:13:43.420
Let's go.

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:44.740
Yay!

00:13:45.400 --> 00:13:47.320
Hold on tight, Rizel.

00:13:47.810 --> 00:13:49.300
Yes, yes!
